Conversation exports go here, and are never committed.

  claude.ai    Settings -> Privacy -> Export data, then unzip conversations.json here
  Claude Code  cp ~/.claude/projects/**/*.jsonl archive/

Then:  python3 tools/ingest_chat_archive.py ingest
       python3 tools/ingest_chat_archive.py search "some phrase"

This file exists so the directory the README tells you to use is actually
present. `.gitignore` ignores archive/ and negates this one path; without the
file committed, that negation had nothing to preserve and the directory did
not exist in a fresh clone.
